If the property `spring.kafka.producer.transaction-id-prefix` is defined, a [`KafkaTransactionManager`](https://docs.spring.io/spring-kafka/docs/3.3.x/api/org/springframework/kafka/transaction/KafkaTransactionManager.html) is automatically configured. Also, if a [`RecordMessageConverter`](https://docs.spring.io/spring-kafka/docs/3.3.x/api/org/springframework/kafka/support/converter/RecordMessageConverter.html) bean is defined, it is automatically associated to the auto-configured [`KafkaTemplate`](https://docs.spring.io/spring-kafka/docs/3.3.x/api/org/springframework/kafka/core/KafkaTemplate.html).   
