You can define as many [`RouterFunction`](https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/6.2.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/web/reactive/function/server/RouterFunction.html) beans as you like to modularize the definition of the router. Beans can be ordered if you need to apply a precedence.   
