  * [Spring AI PostgresML Embeddings](https://docs.spring.io/spring-ai/reference/api/embeddings/postgresml-embeddings.html)
  * [Spring AI Bedrock Cohere Embeddings](https://docs.spring.io/spring-ai/reference/api/embeddings/bedrock-cohere-embedding.html)
  * [Spring AI Bedrock Titan Embeddings](https://docs.spring.io/spring-ai/reference/api/embeddings/bedrock-titan-embedding.html)
